const TEXTS = {"PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockDefeat":"I took you for granted, and so\\nI lost.\\pAs proof of your victory, I confer\\non you this…the official POKéMON\\lLEAGUE BOULDERBADGE.\\p{FONT_NORMAL}{PLAYER} received the BOULDERBADGE\\nfrom BROCK!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\\p{FONT_MALE}Just having the BOULDERBADGE makes\\nyour POKéMON more powerful.\\pIt also enables the use of the\\nmove FLASH outside of battle.\\pOf course, a POKéMON must know the\\nmove FLASH to use it.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_CouldntLoveYouMore":"It couldn't possibly love you\\nany more than it does now.\\pYour POKéMON is happy beyond\\nwords.$","ViridianCity_Text_CitySign":"VIRIDIAN CITY \\nThe Eternally Green Paradise$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainBurn":"A burn reduces ATTACK power.\\nIt also causes ongoing HP loss.\\pA burn remains after a battle.\\nUse BURN HEAL to cure a burn.$","Text_PleaseComeAgain":"Please come again!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedFivePokeBalls":"{PLAYER} received five POKé BALLS.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"PEWTER POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LikeMeToGroomMon":"DAISY: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\nGood timing.\\pI'm about to have some tea.\\nWould you like to join me?\\pOh, but look.\\nYour POKéMON are a little dirty.\\pWould you like me to groom one?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTookBothPokedexUnits":"PROF. OAK took both POKéDEX\\nunits.$","Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_ForestIsMaze":"Are you going to VIRIDIAN FOREST?\\nIt's a natural maze in there.\\lBe careful you don't get lost.$","Text_TastyFood":"Oh, that smells tasty!\\nIt might get the stomach growling!$","ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pBut I made it too strong.\\nIt gave me a headache…\\pIncidentally, are you filling your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pAt first, focus on weakening the\\nPOKéMON before trying to catch it.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelPostBattle":"You can go on to the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE only by defeating our GYM\\lLEADER!$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldPostBattle":"I can't catch anything good.\\nNot one good POKéMON to be had!$","CableClub_Text_SomeoneIsNotReadyToLink":"Someone is not ready to link.\\pPlease come back after everyone\\nhas made preparations.$","Route21_North_Text_WadeDefeat":"Heheh, MAGIKARP just don't make\\nthe grade, do they?$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_AllBoysLeaveOakLookingForYou":"MOM: …Right.\\nAll boys leave home someday.\\lIt said so on TV.\\pOh, yes. PROF. OAK, next door, was\\nlooking for you.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHeyDontGoAwayYet":"OAK: Hey!\\nDon't go away yet!$","PewterCity_Text_MustBeGoingBackToLab":"Well, I must be going back to\\nthe LAB.\\pBye-bye!$","PewterCity_Text_TrainerTipsEarningEXP":"TRAINER TIPS\\pAll POKéMON that appear in battle,\\nhowever briefly, earn EXP Points.$","Text_BeautifulSkyWindow":"Outside the window…\\pThe sky looks fantastically\\nbeautiful.$","CableClub_Text_FirstTimeRightThisWay":"Hello!\\nMy name is TEALA.\\pThis must be your first time\\nup here.\\pI'll show you how the Wireless\\nCommunication System works.\\pFirst, I need to show you this\\nfloor of our POKéMON CENTER.\\pRight this way, please.$","ViridianCity_Text_ThisIsPrivateProperty":"I absolutely forbid you from\\ngoing through here!\\pThis is private property!$","Route3_Text_RobinDefeat":"That's it?$","CableClub_Text_TradePokemon":"Would you like to trade POKéMON?$","PalletTown_Text_OakPokemonResearchLab":"OAK POKéMON RESEARCH LAB$","PalletTown_Text_OhLookLook":"Oh!\\nLook, look!$","CableClub_Text_NoEnigmaBerryInUnionRoom":"No POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY may enter the UNION ROOM.$","Route3_Text_SallyPostBattle":"You can avoid battles by not\\nletting TRAINERS see you.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainFreeze":"A frozen POKéMON becomes\\nhelplessly immobile.\\pIt stays frozen even after the\\nbattle ends.\\pUse ICE HEAL to thaw out the\\nsuffering POKéMON.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCatchMonsForDataTakeThese":"OAK: You can't get detailed data\\non POKéMON by just seeing them.\\pYou must catch them to obtain\\ncomplete data.\\pSo, here are some tools for\\ncatching wild POKéMON.$","Route3_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 3\\nMT. MOON AHEAD$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DoYouKnowWhatAmberIs":"You can't sneak in the back way!\\nNice try, kid, but no.\\pOh, whatever!\\nDo you know what AMBER is?$","PalletTown_Text_RivalsHouse":"{RIVAL}'s house$","PewterCity_Text_CitySign":"PEWTER CITY\\nA Stone Gray City$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyPostBattle":"Sometimes, you can find stuff on\\nthe ground.\\pI'm looking for the stuff I\\ndropped. Can you help me?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakComeSeeMeSometime":"OAK: Come see me sometime.\\pAfter all, I want to know how your\\nPOKéDEX is coming along.$","PalletTown_Text_OakDontGoOut":"OAK: Hey! Wait!\\nDon't go out!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeDefeat":"Yowch!\\nWhiplash!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_CantGroomAnEgg":"Oh, sorry. I honestly can't\\ngroom an EGG.$","PewterCity_Mart_Text_GoodThingsIfRaiseMonsDiligently":"Good things can happen if you raise\\nPOKéMON diligently.\\pEven the weak ones can surprise\\nyou if you don't give up on them.$","ViridianCity_Text_MovesLimitedByPP":"TRAINER TIPS\\pThe battle moves of POKéMON are\\nlimited by their POWER POINTS, PP.\\pTo replenish PP, rest your tired\\nPOKéMON at a POKéMON CENTER.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_HeyDontLookAtMyNotes":"GIRL: Hey!\\nDon't look at my notes!$","Text_IdLoveToHearYourProfile":"Hi, glad to meet you!\\p…That's unfriendly of you.\\nHow about saying hi back?\\pSo, come on, tell me about\\nyourself.\\pI'd love to hear your profile!$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalPostBattle":"I heard the POKéMON LEAGUE is\\ncrawling with tough TRAINERS.\\pI have to figure out how to get\\npast them.\\pYou should quit dawdling and get a\\nmove on!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItLooksVeryHappy":"It looks very happy.\\pI wish {RIVAL} could see this and\\nlearn something from it.$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeader":"Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","Route3_Text_JamesPostBattle":"Trained POKéMON are stronger than\\nthe wild ones.$","Text_PowerPlantMachine":"What could this machine be?\\nBetter not mess around with it!$","ViridianCity_Text_ViridiansGymLeaderReturned":"VIRIDIAN GYM's LEADER returned!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGrampsIsntAround":"{RIVAL}: What, it's only {PLAYER}?\\nGramps isn't around.$","Route21_North_Text_IanIntro":"IAN: My sis doesn't get enough\\nexercise, so I made her come.$","CableClub_Text_PleaseConfirmNumberAndRestart":"Please confirm the number of\\nplayers and start again.$","Text_OhThatsBadgeGoRightAhead":"Oh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!\\nGo right ahead.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ThereYouGoAllDone":"{FONT_NORMAL}{STR_VAR_1} looks dreamily content…\\p{FONT_FEMALE}DAISY: There you go! All done.\\nSee? Doesn't it look nice?\\pGiggle…\\nIt's such a cute POKéMON.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_BlackboardListsStatusProblems":"The blackboard lists POKéMON\\nSTATUS problems during battles.$","Text_OnlySkilledTrainersAllowedThrough":"Only truly skilled TRAINERS are\\nallowed through.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet!$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_GotToBuySomePotions":"I've got to buy some POTIONS.\\pYou never know when your POKéMON\\nwill need quick healing.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WantYouToGetAmberExamined":"Ssh! Listen, I need to share a\\nsecret with someone.\\pI think that this chunk of AMBER\\ncontains POKéMON DNA!\\pIt would be a shattering scientific\\nbreakthrough if POKéMON could be\\lresurrected from it.\\pBut, my colleagues just ignore\\nwhat I have to say.\\pSo, I have a favor to ask!\\pI want you to get this examined at\\na POKéMON LAB somewhere.$","Text_DecorTransferredToPC":"The {STR_VAR_2} was transferred\\nto the PC.$","Text_TrashBin":"Inside this…\\n……\\pThere's nothing here!$","Route21_North_Text_WadeRematchIntro":"I got a big haul again!\\nWanna go for it once more?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsAuthorityOnMons":"PROF. OAK may not look like much,\\nbut he's the authority on POKéMON.\\pMany POKéMON TRAINERS hold him in\\nhigh regard.$","Text_ClosedLinkToProfOaksPC":"Closed link to PROF. OAK's PC.$","Text_SeismicTossTeach":"The secrets of space…\\nThe mysteries of earth…\\pThere are so many things about\\nwhich we know so little.\\pBut that should spur us to study\\nharder, not toss in the towel.\\pThe only thing you should toss…\\pWell, how about SEISMIC TOSS?\\nShould I teach that to a POKéMON?$","Text_MayIHelpYou":"Hi, there!\\nMay I help you?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockPostBattle":"There are all kinds of TRAINERS in\\nthis huge world of ours.\\pYou appear to be very gifted as a\\nPOKéMON TRAINER.\\pSo let me make a suggestion.\\pGo to the GYM in CERULEAN and test\\nyour abilities.$","Route21_North_Text_WadeIntro":"I got a big haul!\\nWanna go for it?$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WhenJiggylypuffSingsMonsGetDrowsy":"Yawn!\\pWhen JIGGLYPUFF sings, POKéMON get\\ndrowsy…\\p…Me, too…\\nSnore…$","Route21_North_Text_LilPostBattle":"LIL: I'm tired.\\nCan't we go home already?$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCancelEvolution":"Do you know the evolution-cancel\\ntechnique?\\pWhen a POKéMON is evolving, you\\ncan stop the process.\\pIt's a technique for raising\\nPOKéMON the way they are.$","Text_ObtainedTheDecor":"Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ReceivedTownMapFromDaisy":"{PLAYER} received a TOWN MAP\\nfrom DAISY.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_SaveOptionInMenu":"The SAVE option is on the MENU.\\nUse it regularly.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCustomBallIOrdered":"Ah! \\nIt's the custom POKé BALL!\\pI had it on order.\\nThank you!$","Route22_Text_LateRivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: What? {PLAYER}!\\nWhat a surprise to see you here!\\pSo you're going to the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE?\\pYou collected all the BADGES, too?\\nThat's cool!\\pThen I'll whip you, {PLAYER}, as a\\nwarm-up for the POKéMON LEAGUE!\\pCome on!$","ViridianCity_House_Text_Speary":"SPEARY: Tetweet!$","Route21_North_Text_IanRematchIntro":"IAN: My sis is still a slob.\\nHelp me get her into shape!$","Text_ProfileSaysSomethingAboutYou":"Hmhm…\\pYour profile really says something\\nabout who you are.\\pNow that I know you better, it \\nmakes us better friends than ever!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ExplainTownMap":"You can use the TOWN MAP to find\\nout where you are, or check the\\lnames of places.$","Route3_Text_CalvinPostBattle":"I always wear shorts, even in\\nwinter. That's my policy.$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeWhichCableClubService":"Welcome to the POKéMON CABLE\\nCLUB.\\pWhich of our services do you wish\\nto use?$","ViridianForest_Text_CharlieDefeat":"Oh!\\nI lost!$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureProfOak":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PROF. OAK,\\nthe POKéMON Researcher!\\pPROF. OAK reportedly lives with his\\ngrandchildren DAISY and {RIVAL}.$","ViridianForest_Text_RickPostBattle":"Ssh! You'll scare the bugs away.\\nAnother time, okay?$","Text_Snacks":"There's a pile of snacks here.$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FeelFreeToUsePC":"Please feel free to use that PC in\\nthe corner.\\pThe receptionist told me so.\\nIt's so kind of her!$","CableClub_Text_CantSingleBattleWithXPlayers":"The SINGLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$","Route3_Text_SallyDefeat":"Be nice!$","Text_DreamEaterWhichMon":"Which POKéMON wants to learn\\nDREAM EATER?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiDefeat":"I ran out of gas!$","Text_PolishedWindow":"The window is very well polished.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ThoseArePokeBalls":"Those are POKé BALLS.\\nThey contain POKéMON!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoToughenMyMon":"{RIVAL}: Okay! I'll make my\\nPOKéMON battle to toughen it up!\\p{PLAYER}! Gramps!\\nSmell you later!$","PalletTown_Text_TownSign":"PALLET TOWN\\nShades of your journey await!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBattleMonForItToGrow":"OAK: {PLAYER}, raise your young\\nPOKéMON by making it battle.\\pIt has to battle for it to grow.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsQuiteFriendly":"It's quite friendly with you.\\nKeep being good to it!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_TurnThePage":"Turn the page?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelDefeat":"I was beaten?$","ViridianForest_Text_DougDefeat":"Huh?\\nI ran out of POKéMON!$","Trade_Text_LookingForMonWannaTradeForMon":"I'm looking for the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pWanna trade one for my\\n{STR_VAR_2}?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakExplainCatching":"When a wild POKéMON appears,\\nit's fair game.\\pJust throw a POKé BALL at it and\\ntry to catch it!\\pThis won't always work, however.\\pA healthy POKéMON can escape.\\nYou have to be lucky!$","Route3_Text_JamesDefeat":"Done like dinner!$","ViridianCity_Text_ExplainCaterpieWeedle":"CATERPIE has no poison,\\nbut WEEDLE does.\\pWatch that your POKéMON aren't\\nstabbed by WEEDLE's POISON STING.$","Text_Burglary":"There are obvious signs of burglary\\nhere…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenIntro":"The truly talented win with style.$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerDefeat":"Ayah!$","ViridianForest_Text_CharlieIntro":"Did you know that POKéMON evolve?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiIntro":"I'm the KARATE KING!\\nYour fate rests with me!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM39FromBrock":"{PLAYER} received TM39\\nfrom BROCK.$","Route3_Text_RobinIntro":"Eek!\\nDid you touch me?$","ViridianForest_Text_CantCatchOwnedMons":"TRAINER TIPS\\pYou can't catch a POKéMON that\\nbelongs to someone else.\\pThrow POKé BALLS only at wild\\nPOKéMON to catch them!$","Text_ImpressiveMachine":"It's a machine of some sort.\\nIt sure is impressive.$","ViridianCity_Text_HowsTeachyTVHelping":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pBut I made it too strong.\\nIt gave me a headache…\\pIncidentally, is my old TEACHY TV\\nhelping you?$","Text_WhatAreYouLikeNow":"What are you like now?\\nI'd really like to know.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThisMonIsEnergetic":"This POKéMON is really quite\\nenergetic!$","Route3_Text_ColtonPostBattle":"There are other kinds of POKéMON\\nthan the ones you find in forests.$","Text_BootedUpPC":"{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$","PalletTown_Text_CaughtXImpressiveFollowMe":"You've caught… {STR_VAR_2}!?\\nNow, this is impressive!\\pThere's something I wanted to ask\\nof you, {PLAYER}.\\pCome.\\nFollow me.$","Text_PlayerIsPlayingRightNowGoForIt":"It appears as if {STR_VAR_1} is playing\\nright now.\\lGo for it!$","PewterCity_Text_ExplainRunningShoes":"Press the B Button to run.\\nBut only where there's room to run!$","PewterCity_Text_DoYouKnowWhatImDoing":"Psssst!\\nDo you know what I'm doing?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice":"Yo!\\nChamp in the making!\\pEven I don't know the VIRIDIAN\\nLEADER's identity.\\pBut one thing's certain.\\nThis will be the toughest of all\\lthe GYM LEADERS.\\pAlso, I heard that the TRAINERS\\nhere like GROUND-type POKéMON.$","ViridianCity_Text_ThatWasEducationalTakeThis":"There! Now tell me, that was\\neducational, was it not?\\pAnd here, take this, too.$","CableClub_Text_PleaseEnter":"Please enter.$","Route21_North_Text_IanNotEnoughMons":"IAN: We want a two-on-two battle.\\nSo can you bring two POKéMON?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainParalysis":"Paralysis reduces SPEED and may\\nprevent the POKéMON from moving.\\pParalysis remains after battles.\\nUse PARLYZ HEAL for treatment.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonDefeat":"You are in perfect harmony!$","Text_WhatsYourProfile":"What's your profile?$","CableClub_Text_DirectYouToYourRoom":"I'll direct you to your room now.$","PewterCity_House1_Text_Nidoran":"NIDORAN♂: Bowbow!$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyDefeat":"I give!\\nYou're good at this!$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyIntro":"I might be little, but I won't like\\nit if you go easy on me!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: GIOVANNI\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","Trade_Text_AwwOhWell":"Awww!\\nOh, well…$","Route22_Text_LateRivalDefeat":"What!?\\pI was just careless, you!$","Text_AccessWhichPC":"Which PC should be accessed?$","Text_OnlyPassWithBadgeOhGoAhead":"You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pOh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_LEVEL_UP}{PAUSE 0x60}{RESUME_MUSIC}\\pOkay, then.\\nPlease, go right ahead.$","PokedexRating_Text_LookForwardToFilledNationalDex":"I'll be looking forward to seeing\\nyou fill the NATIONAL POKéDEX!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_TryDifferentPartyOrders":"The first POKéMON out in a match is\\nat the left of the POKéMON LIST.\\pBy changing the order of POKéMON,\\nyou may gain an advantage.\\pTry different orders to suit your\\nopponent's party.$","CableClub_Text_LinkErrorPleaseReset":"Sorry, we have a link error…\\nPlease reset and try again.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DaisyWillGroomMons":"Hi, {PLAYER}. I bet you've become\\ngood friends with your POKéMON.\\pBy the way, did you know about\\nDAISY?\\pIf you show DAISY your POKéMON,\\nshe can tell how much it likes you.\\pOccasionally, she will even groom\\na POKéMON for you.\\pThis is a secret, so please don't\\ntell anyone.$","ViridianCity_Text_GymDoorsAreLocked":"VIRIDIAN GYM's doors are locked…$","Text_DecidedNotTo":"Oh, you've decided not to?\\nYou're fickle, aren't you?$","Text_ATownMap":"A TOWN MAP.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberIsFossilizedSap":"AMBER is actually sap, that gooey\\nstuff that oozes from trees.\\pThe ancient sap fossilized over\\ntime to become rock-hard AMBER.$","ViridianCity_Text_GrandpaHasntHadCoffeeYet":"Oh, Grandpa!\\nDon't be so mean!\\pI'm so sorry.\\nHe hasn't had his coffee yet.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllTakeThisOneThen":"{RIVAL}: I'll take this one, then!$","Text_Dresser":"It's a nicely made dresser.\\nIt will hold a lot of stuff.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockIntro":"So, you're here. I'm BROCK.\\nI'm PEWTER's GYM LEADER.\\pMy rock-hard willpower is evident\\neven in my POKéMON.\\pMy POKéMON are all rock hard, and\\nhave true-grit determination.\\pThat's right - my POKéMON are all\\nthe ROCK type!\\pFuhaha! You're going to challenge\\nme knowing that you'll lose?\\pThat's the TRAINER's honor that\\ncompels you to challenge me.\\pFine, then!\\nShow me your best!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeUnionRoomEnter":"Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB UNION ROOM.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nother TRAINERS here, some of\\lwhom you may not even know.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalDefeat":"Awww!\\nYou just lucked out!$","ViridianForest_Text_LeavingViridianForest":"LEAVING VIRIDIAN FOREST\\nPEWTER CITY AHEAD$","Route3_Text_JaniceRematchIntro":"Excuse me!\\nYou keep looking at me, don't you?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelIntro":"VIRIDIAN GYM was closed for a\\nlong time.\\pBut now, our LEADER is back!$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GreatHereYouGo":"Great! You have caught or owned\\n{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\\pCongratulations!\\nHere you go!$","ViridianCity_Text_CatchMonsForEasierBattles":"TRAINER TIPS\\pCatch POKéMON and expand your\\ncollection.\\pThe more you have, the easier it\\nis to battle.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MovieOnTVGirlOnBrickRoad":"There's a movie on TV.\\nA girl with her hair in pigtails is\\lwalking up a brick road.\\p…I better go, too.$","PewterCity_Text_BrockOnlySeriousTrainerHere":"There aren't many serious POKéMON\\nTRAINERS here.\\pThey're all like BUG CATCHERS,\\nyou know, just hobbyists.\\pBut PEWTER GYM's BROCK isn't like\\nthat, not one bit.$","Text_TreeCanBeCutDown":"This tree looks like it can be CUT\\ndown!$","ViridianCity_Text_MyGrandsonOnTheShow":"Wahaha!\\nIt's my grandson on the show!\\pSince he's the one doing the\\nteaching, you're bound to learn.$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ReceivedHM05FromAide":"{PLAYER} received HM05\\nfrom the AIDE.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_TakeThisToProfOak":"You know PROF. OAK, right?\\pHis order came in.\\nCan I get you to take it to him?$","Route3_Text_CalvinIntro":"Hey! You're not wearing shorts!\\nWhat's wrong with you?$","Route3_Text_SallyIntro":"That look you gave me…\\nIt's so intriguing!$","Text_AccessedProfOaksPC":"Accessed PROF. OAK's PC…\\pAccessed the POKéDEX Rating\\nSystem…$","PalletTown_Text_LookCopiedTrainerTipsSign":"Look, look!\\pI copied what it said on one of\\nthose TRAINER TIPS signs!$","Text_PutItemAway":"{PLAYER} put the {STR_VAR_2}\\nin the {STR_VAR_3}.$","Trade_Text_HeyThanks":"Hey, thanks!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalReceivedMonFromOak":"{RIVAL} received the {STR_VAR_1}\\nfrom PROF. OAK!$","CableClub_Text_TrainerCardDataOverwritten":"The TRAINER CARD data will\\nbe overwritten.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ItsFreeLetsGetHappening":"It's a free service!\\nLet's get happening!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_2F_Text_PressLRForHelp":"It's a posted notice…\\pIf you're confused, ask for HELP!\\nPress the L or R Button!$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_ManyMonsOnlyInForests":"Many POKéMON live only in forests \\nand caves.\\pYou need to be persistent and look\\neverywhere to get different kinds.$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsToTrade":"For trading, you must have at\\nleast two POKéMON with you.$","Text_DreamEaterDeclined":"…Snore…$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_MayISeeFirstMon":"DAISY: Your POKéMON grow to love\\nyou if you raise them with love.\\pFor example, {PLAYER}, may I see\\nyour first POKéMON?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadWhichTopic":"Which topic do you want to read?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalJustLetMeHandleEverything":"{RIVAL}: Hey, I heard that!\\pGramps, what's with favoring\\n{PLAYER} over me all the time?\\pI went and collected more POKéMON,\\nand faster, too.\\pYou should just let me handle\\neverything.$","Route3_Text_BenIntro":"Hi!\\nI like shorts!\\pThey're delightfully comfy and\\neasy to wear!$","CableClub_Text_ExplainBattleModes":"There are three Battle Modes.\\pSINGLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.\\pDOUBLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith two or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER will send out two\\nPOKéMON in battle at a time.\\pMULTI BATTLE is for four TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.$","PokedexRating_Text_ThankYouMadeDreamReality":"Thank you, {PLAYER}!\\nSincerely, thank you!\\lYou've made my dream a reality!$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GiveHM05IfSeen10Mons":"Hi! Remember me?\\nI'm one of PROF. OAK's AIDES.\\pIf your POKéDEX has complete data\\non ten species, I'm supposed to\\lgive you a reward.\\pPROF. OAK entrusted me with\\nHM05 for you.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, let me ask you.\\pHave you gathered data on at least\\nten kinds of POKéMON?$","ViridianCity_Text_WantToKnowAboutCaterpillarMons":"You want to know about the two\\nkinds of caterpillar POKéMON?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakFavorToAskYouPlayer":"Ah, now this is excellent!\\p{PLAYER}, I have another important\\nfavor to ask of you.\\pI need you to listen closely.$","PewterCity_Mart_Text_BoughtWeirdFishFromShadyGuy":"A shady old guy sucked me into\\nbuying this weird fish POKéMON!\\pIt's totally weak and it cost ¥500!$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldDefeat":"Dang!$","PewterCity_Text_WerentThoseFossilsAmazing":"Weren't those fossils from MT. MOON\\namazing?$","Route3_Text_JamesIntro":"I'll battle you with the POKéMON\\nI just caught.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamIntro":"Stop right there, kid!\\pYou're ten thousand light-years \\nfrom facing BROCK!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiIntro":"Rrrroar!\\nI'm working myself into a rage!$","Aide_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForItem":"Oh! I see you don't have any\\nroom for the {STR_VAR_2}.$","Route3_Text_RobinPostBattle":"ROUTE 4 is at the foot of\\nMT. MOON.$","Route3_Text_CalvinRematchIntro":"Hey! What's wrong with you?\\nYou're still not wearing shorts!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookThirdPage":"Third page…\\pPOKéMON TRAINERS seek others to\\nengage in POKéMON battles.\\pTo TRAINERS, the taste of victory\\nis sweet, indeed.\\pBattles are constantly waged at\\nPOKéMON GYMS everywhere.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_YouShouldTakeQuickRest":"MOM: {PLAYER}!\\nYou should take a quick rest.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"PEWTER POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiDefeat":"Wargh!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiPostBattle":"I'm still not worthy!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColePostBattle":"Wait!\\nI was just careless!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Right50YThankYou":"Right, ¥50!\\nThank you!$","Text_DishesPlatesNeatlyLinedUp":"Dishes and plates are neatly\\nlined up.$","Text_PokecenterSign":"Heal Your POKéMON!\\nPOKéMON CENTER$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_MeteoriteThatFellOnMtMoon":"A meteorite that fell on MT. MOON.\\nIt is thought to be a MOON STONE.$","PalletTown_Text_SignsAreUsefulArentThey":"Signs are useful, aren't they?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamPostBattle":"You're pretty hot.\\n…But not as hot as BROCK!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PleaseEnjoyYourself":"Please enjoy yourself.$","ViridianCity_Text_GoShoppingInPewterOccasionally":"I go shopping in PEWTER CITY\\noccasionally.\\pI have to take the winding trail in\\nVIRIDIAN FOREST when I go.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBePatientRival":"OAK: Be patient, {RIVAL}.\\nYou can have one, too!$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyPostBattle":"I lost some of my allowance…$","Text_HeardThatBefore":"Oh, I've heard that before…\\pMy cousin, who lives far away,\\nalways used to say that, I think.$","Text_AccessedSomeonesPC":"Accessed Someone's PC.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakAddedNothingToPokedex":"Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nHow is your POKéDEX shaping up?\\p{RIVAL} has already caught some\\nPOKéMON and added to the data.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, let's have a look at\\nyour POKéDEX.\\p…What's the matter?\\nYou've added no new data at all.\\pI'll give you these, so do try a\\nlittle harder.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniIntro":"Fwahahaha!\\nWelcome to my hideout!\\pIt shall be so until I can restore\\nTEAM ROCKET to its former glory.\\pBut, you have found me again.\\nSo be it.\\lThis time, I'm not holding back!\\pOnce more, you shall face\\nGIOVANNI, the greatest TRAINER!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}$","PalletTown_Text_ReadItReadIt":"Read it, read it!$","PewterCity_Text_ThatsRightItsHardWork":"That's right!\\nIt's hard work!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGramps":"{RIVAL}: Gramps!$","ViridianForest_Text_DougPostBattle":"That totally stinks! I'm going to\\ncatch some stronger ones!$","PewterCity_Text_BrocksLookingForChallengersFollowMe":"You're a TRAINER, right?\\pBROCK's looking for new\\nchallengers. Follow me!$","Text_Computer":"It's all complicated words and\\nnumbers that make no sense…$","Route22_Text_LateRivalPostBattle":"That loosened me up.\\nI'm ready for the POKéMON LEAGUE!\\p{PLAYER}, you need more practice.\\pBut hey, you know that!\\nI'm out of here. Smell ya!$","ViridianForest_Text_WeakenMonsBeforeCapture":"TRAINER TIPS\\pWeaken POKéMON before attempting\\ncapture!\\pWhen healthy, they may escape!$","Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_RattataHasWickedBite":"RATTATA may be small, but don't\\nunderestimate its wicked bite.\\pHave you caught one already?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ErrandForGrandpaThisWillHelp":"Grandpa asked you to run an\\nerrand?\\pGee, that's lazy of him.\\nHere, this will help you.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ShouldBeGratefulForLongLife":"I should be grateful for my long\\nlife.\\pNever did I think I would get to\\nsee the bones of a dragon!$","Route3_Text_GregRematchIntro":"You're a TRAINER, aren't you?\\nLet's get with it right away!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniDefeat":"Ha!\\nThat was a truly intense fight.\\lYou have won!\\pAs proof, here is the EARTHBADGE!\\n{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiDefeat":"Ayah!$","Text_Bookshelf":"It's crammed full of POKéMON\\nbooks.$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_CanGetThroughRockTunnel":"Once a POKéMON learns FLASH, you\\ncan get through ROCK TUNNEL.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookSecondPage":"Second page…\\pA healthy POKéMON may be hard to\\ncatch, so weaken it first.\\pPoison, burn, or cause another\\nstatus problem to weaken it.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_WhyWouldMonHateYouSoMuch":"…Um, it's not easy for me to say\\nthis, but…\\pIs there some reason why your\\nPOKéMON would hate you so much?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalFedUpWithWaiting":"{RIVAL}: Gramps!\\nI'm fed up with waiting!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiPostBattle":"You'll need power to keep up with\\nour GYM LEADER.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_SayHiToOakForMe":"Okay, thanks! Please say hi to\\nPROF. OAK for me, too.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniPostBattle":"Having lost in this fashion, \\nI can't face my followers.\\lI have betrayed their trust.\\pAs of today, TEAM ROCKET is\\nfinished forever!\\pAs for myself, I shall dedicate\\nmy life to training again.\\pLet us meet again someday!\\nFarewell!$","Text_WeHopeToSeeYouAgain":"We hope to see you again!$","PewterCity_Text_ThisIsTheMuseum":"This is it, the MUSEUM.\\pYou have to pay to get in, but it's\\nworth it. See you around!$","Text_PokeMartShelf":"Wow!\\nTons of POKéMON stuff!$","PalletTown_Text_CanStoreItemsAndMonsInPC":"Technology is incredible!\\pYou can now store and recall items\\nand POKéMON as data via PC.$","CableClub_Text_ExplainWirelessClubFirstTime":"On the top floor, there are two\\nrooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadBlackboardCarefully":"Okay!\\pBe sure to read what's on the\\nblackboard carefully!$","ViridianForest_Text_RanOutOfPokeBalls":"I was throwing POKé BALLS to\\ncatch POKéMON, and I ran out.\\pThat's why you can never have too\\nmany POKé BALLS.$","CableClub_Text_IncorrectNumberOfParticipants":"The number of participants is\\nincorrect.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingSquirtle":"Hm! SQUIRTLE is your choice.\\nIt's one worth raising.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you've decided on the\\nWATER POKéMON SQUIRTLE?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLeaveItToMeGramps":"{RIVAL}: All right, Gramps!\\nLeave it all to me!$","Text_SeismicTossWhichMon":"Which POKéMON wants to learn\\nSEISMIC TOSS?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis":"You don't have space for this.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveSomethingForMe":"OAK: Oh, {PLAYER}!\\nHow is my old POKéMON?\\pWell, it seems to be growing more\\nattached to you.\\pYou must be talented as a POKéMON\\nTRAINER.\\pWhat's that?\\nYou have something for me?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis":"You don't have space for this in\\nyour BAG.$","Text_SeismicTossDeclined":"Is that so?\\nI'm sure you'll be back for it.$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureBrock":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PEWTER GYM\\nLEADER BROCK!\\pBROCK rarely laughs, but is said to\\nbe unable to stop if he starts.$","Route3_Text_ColtonDefeat":"You beat me again!$","PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsEasierCatchIfStatused":"A POKéMON becomes easier to \\ncatch if it has a status problem.\\pSleep, poison, burn, or paralysis…\\nThose are all effective.\\pBut catching POKéMON is never\\na sure thing!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalMyMonLooksTougher":"{RIVAL}: My POKéMON looks a lot\\ntougher than yours.$","ViridianCity_Text_CanCarryMonsAnywhere":"Those POKé BALLS at your waist!\\nYou have POKéMON, don't you?\\pIt's great that you can carry and\\nuse POKéMON anytime, anywhere.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsGoingToHaveRadioShow":"PROF. OAK is going to have his own\\nradio show soon.\\pThe program will be called PROF.\\nOAK's POKéMON SEMINAR.$","PokedexRating_Text_YouveCompletedDex":"Finally…\\pYou've finally completed the\\nPOKéDEX!\\pIt's magnificent!\\nTruly, this is a fantastic feat!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenDefeat":"I lost my grip!$","PalletTown_Text_OakYouEnjoyingTraveling":"OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nYou seem to be enjoying traveling.\\pKnowing you, {PLAYER}, I can easily\\nimagine you going out to even more\\lexotic locales.\\pGood for you, good for you.\\nHohoho.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AerodactylFossil":"AERODACTYL Fossil\\nA primitive and rare POKéMON.$","Route21_North_Text_LilIntro":"LIL: Huh? A battle?\\nIAN, can't you do it alone?$","ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouHowToCatchMons":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pHm?\\nWhat is that red box you have?\\pAh, so you're working on your\\nPOKéDEX.\\pThen let me give you a word of\\nadvice.\\pWhenever you catch a POKéMON,\\nthe POKéDEX automatically updates\\lits data.\\p…You don't know how to catch\\na POKéMON?\\pI suppose I had better show you\\nthen!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_StudyAsOaksAide":"I study POKéMON as PROF. OAK's\\nAIDE.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MovieOnTVFourBoysOnRailroad":"There's a movie on TV.\\nFour boys are walking on railroad\\ltracks.\\p…I better go, too.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_HeardYouBattledRival":"DAISY: {PLAYER}, I heard you had\\na battle against {RIVAL}.\\pI wish I'd seen that!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_KabutopsFossil":"KABUTOPS Fossil\\nA primitive and rare POKéMON.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SpaceShuttle":"Space Shuttle$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeaderOfTwo":"Please decide which of you two\\nwill become the LEADER.\\pThe other player must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","Text_WouldYouLikeToMixRecords":"Would you like to mix records with\\nother TRAINERS?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThreeMonsChooseOne":"OAK: {RIVAL}?\\nLet me think…\\pOh, that's right, I told you to\\ncome! Just wait!\\pHere, {PLAYER}.\\pThere are three POKéMON here.\\pHaha!\\pThe POKéMON are held inside\\nthese POKé BALLS.\\pWhen I was young, I was a serious\\nPOKéMON TRAINER.\\pBut now, in my old age, I have\\nonly these three left.\\pYou can have one.\\nGo on, choose!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_2F_Text_PlayedWithNES":"{PLAYER} played with the NES.\\p…Okay!\\nIt's time to go!$","Route22_Text_LeagueGateSign":"POKéMON LEAGUE\\nFront Gate$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMustReallyWorkToFillPokedex":"Now, {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}!\\pThis time, you really must work\\ntowards filling your POKéDEXES.\\pI urge you to make them the best\\nand the most complete of all time!\\pTruly, this is a monumentally great\\nundertaking in POKéMON history!$","ViridianForest_Text_RickIntro":"Hey! You have POKéMON!\\nCome on!\\lLet's battle 'em!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsBigMapOfKanto":"It's a big map of the KANTO region.\\nNow this would be useful!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DeliveredOaksParcel":"{PLAYER} delivered OAK'S PARCEL.$","CableClub_Text_UnionRoomInfo":"The TRAINERS in the UNION ROOM\\nwill be those players around you\\lwho have also entered the ROOM.\\pYou may do all sorts of things\\nhere, such as exchanging greetings.\\pYou may enter two POKéMON up to\\nLv. 30 for a one-on-one battle.\\pYou may take part in a chat with\\ntwo to five people.\\pOr, you may register a POKéMON for\\ntrade.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$","Route1_Text_WorkAtPokeMartTakeSample":"Hi!\\nI work at a POKéMON MART.\\pIt's part of a convenient chain\\nselling all sorts of items.\\pPlease, visit us in VIRIDIAN CITY.\\pI know, I'll give you a sample.\\nHere you go!$","CableClub_Text_HopeToSeeYouAgain":"I hope to see you again!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_AllMonTypesHaveStrongAndWeakPoints":"All POKéMON types have strong and\\nweak points against others.$","Route2_Text_DiglettsCave":"DIGLETT'S CAVE$","CableClub_Text_CantTradeEnigmaBerry":"A POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY can't be traded.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_DontHaveRoomForThis":"You don't have room for this.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontNeedAnyGrooming":"You don't need any grooming done?\\nOkay, we'll just have tea.$","CableClub_Text_NeedFourPlayers":"There must be four players to play\\nthis Battle Mode.$","ViridianForest_Text_CharliePostBattle":"BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\\nThey're a lot of fun!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakPokedexOnDesk":"On the desk there is my invention,\\nthe POKéDEX!\\pIt automatically records data on\\nPOKéMON you've seen or caught.\\pIt's a high-tech encyclopedia!$","PokedexRating_Text_NationalDexSeenXOwnedY":"And your NATIONAL POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.$","Text_SeismicTossTaught":"I hope you won't toss in the towel.\\nKeep it up.$","Text_VideoGame":"It's the latest video game!\\nIt sure looks fun!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PlayersPokedexWasUpgraded":"{PLAYER}'s POKéDEX was upgraded!$","PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsLearnTechniquesAsTheyGrow":"POKéMON learn new techniques as\\nthey grow.\\pBut some moves must be taught to\\nthem by people.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM26FromGiovanni":"{PLAYER} received TM26\\nfrom GIOVANNI.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_ShopDoesGoodBusinessInAntidotes":"This shop does good business in\\nANTIDOTES, I've heard.$","PewterCity_House1_Text_NidoranSit":"NIDORAN, sit!$","PewterCity_House1_Text_TradeMonsAreFinicky":"Our POKéMON's an outsider, so it's\\nfinicky and hard to handle.\\pAn outsider is a POKéMON that you\\nget in a trade.\\pIt grows fast, but it may ignore an\\nunskilled TRAINER in battle.\\pIf only we had some BADGES…$","CableClub_Text_CantDoubleBattleWithXPlayers":"The DOUBLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllCompleteThePokedex":"{RIVAL}: Gramps, calm down.\\nDon't get so excited.\\pI'll get the POKéDEX completed,\\ndon't you worry about a thing.\\pI think I'll try looking around\\nONE ISLAND first…\\pAnyways, I'm outta here!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YouDoNotHaveSpace":"You do not have space for this!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainEarthBadgeTakeThis":"The EARTHBADGE makes POKéMON of\\nany level obey without question.\\pIt is evidence of your mastery as\\na POKéMON TRAINER.\\pWith it, you can challenge the\\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.\\pAlso, take this TM.\\pConsider it a gift for your POKéMON\\nLEAGUE challenge.$","Text_Kitchen":"It smells delicious!\\nSomebody's been cooking here.$","Route21_North_Text_WadePostBattle":"I seem to only catch MAGIKARP!$","Text_ThankYouForAccessingMysteryGift":"Thank you for accessing the\\nMYSTERY GIFT System.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM39":"A TM, Technical Machine, contains a\\ntechnique for POKéMON.\\pUsing a TM teaches the move it\\ncontains to a POKéMON.\\pA TM is good for only one use.\\pSo, when you use one, pick the\\nPOKéMON carefully.\\pAnyways…\\nTM39 contains ROCK TOMB.\\pIt hurls boulders at the foe and\\nlowers its SPEED.$","Trade_Text_IsntMyOldMonGreat":"Isn't my old {STR_VAR_2} great?$","CableClub_Text_NeedBerryForBerryCrush":"To use the BERRY CRUSH service,\\nyou must have at least one BERRY.$","Route23_Text_VictoryRoadGateSign":"VICTORY ROAD GATE -\\nPOKéMON LEAGUE$","Text_CutTreeDown":"This tree looks like it can be CUT\\ndown!\\pWould you like to CUT it?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalTellSisNotToGiveYouMap":"{PLAYER}, I hate to say it, but you\\nwon't be necessary for this.\\pI know! I'll borrow a TOWN MAP\\nfrom my sis!\\pI'll tell her not to lend you one,\\n{PLAYER}! Hahaha!\\pDon't bother coming around to\\nmy place after this!$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TeamRocketMtMoonImOnPhone":"What!?\\pTEAM ROCKET is at MT. MOON?\\nHuh?\\pI'm on the phone!\\nScram!$","Text_NeatlyLinedUpTools":"All sorts of tools are lined up\\nneatly.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_TryingToMemorizeNotes":"Whew! I'm trying to memorize all my\\nnotes.$","Text_MoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce":"This move can be learned only\\nonce. Is that okay?$","Route3_Text_JaniceIntro":"Excuse me!\\nYou looked at me, didn't you?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_NotFamiliarWithYouYet":"It's not quite familiar with you\\nyet.\\pPOKéMON are all quite wary when\\nyou first get them.$","Text_CantLetYouPass":"Rules are rules.\\nI can't let you pass.$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsForDoubleBattle":"For a DOUBLE BATTLE, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedMonFromOak":"{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_1}\\nfrom PROF. OAK!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WeHaveTwoFossilsOnExhibit":"We have two fossils of rare,\\nprehistoric POKéMON on exhibit.$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Jigglypuff":"JIGGLYPUFF: Puu pupuu!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLetsCheckOutMons":"{RIVAL}: Wait, {PLAYER}!\\nLet's check out our POKéMON!\\pCome on, I'll take you on!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory":"Blow me away! GIOVANNI was the\\nGYM LEADER of VIRIDIAN?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalDefeat":"WHAT?\\nUnbelievable!\\lI picked the wrong POKéMON!$","Route1_Text_CanJumpFromLedges":"See those ledges along the road?\\pIt's a bit scary, but you can jump\\nfrom them.\\pYou can get back to PALLET TOWN\\nquicker that way.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMonsAroundWorldWait":"POKéMON around the world wait for\\nyou, {PLAYER}!$","Route3_Text_SallyRematchIntro":"That look you give me…\\nIt intrigues me so!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenPostBattle":"The LEADER will scold me for\\nlosing this way…$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCenterInEveryTown":"There's a POKéMON CENTER in every\\ntown ahead.\\pThey charge no money, so don't\\nbe shy about healing POKéMON.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsWarmingUpToYou":"It's warming up to you.\\nTrust must be growing between you.$","Text_Food":"It should be packed with all kinds\\nof delicious things to eat.$","Text_LikeProfileWayItIs":"Okay, you like your profile the\\nway it is.\\pI think so, too.$","Route3_Text_TunnelFromCeruleanTiring":"Whew… I better take a rest…\\nGroan…\\pThat tunnel from CERULEAN takes a\\nlot out of you!$","CableClub_Text_AskAboutLinking":"Hello, {PLAYER}!\\pIt's me, TEALA, the POKéMON\\nCENTER 2F attendant.\\pIs there something you needed to\\nask me about linking?$","Route2_House_Text_FaintedMonsCanUseFieldMoves":"A fainted POKéMON just has no\\nenergy left to battle.\\pIt can still use moves like CUT\\noutside of battle.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveEnoughMoney":"You don't have enough money.$","CableClub_Text_OtherTrainerNotReady":"The other TRAINER is not ready.$","Text_TellMeWhatsYourProfile":"Tell me something good about\\nyourself. What's your profile?$","ViridianCity_Text_WatchThatToLearnBasics":"If there's something you don't\\nunderstand, watch that.\\pIt will teach you about the basics\\nof being a POKéMON TRAINER.$","CableClub_Text_UnionRoomAdapterNotConnected":"This is the POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB\\nUNION ROOM.\\pUnfortunately, your Wireless\\nAdapter is not connected properly.\\pPlease do come again.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BoughtColorTVForMoonLanding":"July 20, 1969!\\pHumankind first set foot on the\\nmoon that day.\\pI bought a color TV just so I\\ncould watch that news.$","CableClub_Text_EnjoyUnionRoom":"I hope you enjoy your time in\\nthe UNION ROOM.$","Route3_Text_BenRematchIntro":"Hi! I like shorts!\\nThey're comfy and easy to wear!\\pYou should be wearing shorts, too!$","ViridianCity_Text_OhOkayThen":"Oh, okay then!$","ViridianCity_Text_GymClosedWonderWhoLeaderIs":"This POKéMON GYM is always closed.\\pI wonder who the LEADER is?$","Route3_Text_RobinRematchIntro":"Eek!\\nDid you push me?$","CableClub_Text_ExplainWirelessClub":"Let me explain how the POKéMON\\nWIRELESS CLUB works.\\pOn this, the top floor, there are\\ntwo rooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pSometimes, you may not be able to\\nfind your friends in the UNION ROOM\\lor the DIRECT CORNER.\\pIn that case, please move closer\\nto your friends.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$","Text_DreamEaterTeach":"Yawn!\\nI must have dozed off in the sun.\\pI had this weird dream about\\na DROWZEE eating my dream.\\pAnd…\\nI learned how to eat dreams…\\pOogh, this is too spooky!\\pLet me teach it to a POKéMON so\\nI can forget about it!$","Text_DontBeLikeThat":"Aww… Don't be like that.\\nYou can tell me your profile.$","PewterCity_Text_RunningShoesLetterFromMom":"There's a letter attached…\\pDear {PLAYER},\\pHere is a pair of RUNNING SHOES\\nfor my beloved challenger.\\pRemember, I'll always cheer for\\nyou! Don't ever give up!\\pFrom Mom$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCutSkinnyTrees":"Have you noticed the skinny trees\\non the roadside?\\pThey can be cut down by a special\\nPOKéMON move, I hear.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoDefeat":"Aiyah!$","CableClub_Text_NotSetUpForFarAwayRegion":"I'm awfully sorry.\\pWe're not set up to conduct trades\\nwith TRAINERS far away in another\\lregion yet…$","Text_RestoredPkmnToFullHealth":"Thank you for waiting.\\nWe've restored your POKéMON to\\lfull health.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PikachuSoonIPromise":"Yeah, a PIKACHU soon, I promise!$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldIntro":"You want to know if the fish are\\nbiting?$","CableClub_Text_PlayersMadeDifferentSelections":"The link partners appear to have\\nmade different selections.$","Route3_Text_BenPostBattle":"Are you using a POKéMON CENTER's\\nPC for storing your POKéMON?\\pEach BOX can hold up to\\n30 POKéMON.$","PokedexRating_Text_LoveSeeingYourPokedex":"OAK: Ah, welcome!\\pTell me, how is your POKéDEX\\ncoming along?\\pWahaha!\\pActually, I know how it is, but I\\nlove seeing it anyway!\\pLet's see…$","CableClub_Text_UseBerryCrush":"Would you like to use the\\nBERRY CRUSH System?$","PalletTown_Text_RaisingMonsToo":"I'm raising POKéMON, too.\\pWhen they get strong, they can\\nprotect me.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM26":"TM26 contains EARTHQUAKE.\\pIt is a powerful attack that causes\\na massive tremor.\\pI made it when I ran the GYM here,\\nfar too long ago… $","Route21_North_Text_IanDefeat":"IAN: Awww, Sis!\\nGet it together!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ShelvesCrammedFullOfBooks":"The shelves are crammed full of\\nbooks on POKéMON.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonPostBattle":"Do you know the identity of our\\nGYM LEADER?$","Route21_North_Text_LilNotEnoughMons":"LIL: Huh? A battle?\\nI can't be bothered to do it alone.\\lBring two POKéMON, won't you?$","Route3_Text_ColtonIntro":"Hey!\\nI saw you in VIRIDIAN FOREST!$","ViridianForest_Text_DougIntro":"Yo!\\nYou can't jam out if you're a\\lPOKéMON TRAINER!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_GroomWhichOne":"Which one should I groom?$","Text_ChangeYourProfile":"Would you like to change your\\nprofile?$","PalletTown_Text_PlayersHouse":"{PLAYER}'s house$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonIntro":"POKéMON and I, we make wonderful\\nmusic together!$","Route3_Text_JaniceDefeat":"You're mean!$","PewterCity_Text_GoTakeOnBrock":"If you have the right stuff,\\ngo take on BROCK!$","PewterCity_Text_ReallyYouHaveToGo":"Really?\\nYou absolutely have to go!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_YoureChampMaterial":"Just as I thought!\\nYou're POKéMON champ material!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_GetOldAmberChecked":"Ssh!\\nGet the OLD AMBER checked!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCanReachNextTownWithMon":"OAK: If a wild POKéMON appears,\\nyour POKéMON can battle it.\\pWith it at your side, you should be\\nable to reach the next town.$","Text_FoundOneItem":"{PLAYER} found one {STR_VAR_2}!$","PewterCity_Text_OhPlayer":"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeWhichDirectCornerRoom":"Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nyour friends here.\\pWhich room would you like to\\nenter?$","PewterCity_Text_SprayingRepelToKeepWildMonsOut":"I'm spraying REPEL to keep wild\\nPOKéMON out of my garden!$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyDefeat":"Oh, boo.\\nNothing went right.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_LookingGreatTakeCare":"MOM: Oh, good! You and your\\nPOKéMON are looking great.\\lTake care now!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu":"Press START to open the MENU!$","Text_TooBadBagFull":"Too bad!\\nThe BAG is full…$","Route3_Text_GregDefeat":"If I had new POKéMON, I would've\\nwon!$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeaderOfFour":"Please decide which of you four\\nwill become the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou":"Wait!\\nTake this with you.$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsForUnionRoom":"To enter the UNION ROOM, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.$","Text_OpenedPkmnStorage":"POKéMON Storage System opened.$","Text_HavePokedexRated":"Would you like to have your\\nPOKéDEX rated?$","PewterCity_Text_SwitchedShoesWithRunningShoes":"{PLAYER} switched shoes with the\\nRUNNING SHOES.$","ViridianCity_House_Text_SpearowNameSpeary":"SPEAROW\\nName: SPEARY$","PewterCity_Text_MuseumOfScience":"PEWTER MUSEUM OF SCIENCE$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamDefeat":"Darn!\\pLight-years isn't time…\\nIt measures distance!$","PalletTown_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu":"TRAINER TIPS\\pPress START to open the MENU!$","Route1_Text_ComeSeeUsIfYouNeedPokeBalls":"Please come see us if you need\\nPOKé BALLS for catching POKéMON.$","Text_Painting":"It's a pretty picture of a POKéMON.\\nIt looks like it's feeling good.$","Text_HiWeMeetAgain":"Hi!\\nWe meet again!$","Route21_North_Text_LilDefeat":"LIL: Oh, see?\\nWe lost. Happy now?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ComeAgain":"Come again!$","Text_WirelessClubUndergoingAdjustments":"I'm terribly sorry.\\nThe POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB is\\lundergoing adjustments now.$","CableClub_Text_YouHaveAMonThatCantBeTaken":"You have at least one POKéMON\\nthat can't be taken.$","Route1_Text_PutPotionAway":"{PLAYER} put the POTION away in\\nthe BAG's ITEMS POCKET.$","Text_WelcomeWantToHealPkmn":"Welcome to our POKéMON CENTER!\\pWould you like me to heal your\\nPOKéMON back to perfect health?$","ViridianCity_House_Text_MyDaddyLovesMonsToo":"My daddy loves POKéMON, too.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberContainsGeneticMatter":"AMBER contains the genetic matter\\nof ancient POKéMON.\\pThere's a LAB somewhere trying to\\nresurrect POKéMON from AMBER.$","Text_MonUsedMove":"{STR_VAR_1} used {STR_VAR_2}!$","Text_PlayerFacingTVScreen":"There's a POKéMON on TV!\\nIt looks like it's having fun.$","Route3_Text_BenDefeat":"I don't believe it!$","Text_ObtainedTheX":"Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$","ViridianCity_Text_TooBusyForTeachyTV":"Hm… You're too busy to not even\\nhave the time for TEACHY TV…\\pTime is money, and neither should\\nbe ill spent…$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LovelyAndSweetClefairy":"“The lovely and sweet\\nCLEFAIRY”$","PewterCity_Text_AskedToDeliverThis":"I'm glad I caught up to you.\\nI'm PROF. OAK's AIDE.\\pI've been asked to deliver this,\\nso here you go.$","PewterCity_Text_CallPoliceIfInfoOnThieves":"NOTICE!\\pThieves have been stealing POKéMON\\nfossils from MT. MOON.\\pPlease call the PEWTER POLICE if\\nyou have any information.$","OneIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UsualPCServicesUnavailable":"The usual PC services aren't\\navailable…$","Route3_Text_GregPostBattle":"If a POKéMON BOX on the PC gets\\nfull, just switch to another BOX.$","Text_OnlyPassWithBadgeDontHaveYet":"You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet.\\pYou have to have it to get to\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE.$","PewterCity_Text_DidYouCheckOutMuseum":"Did you check out the MUSEUM?$","PalletTown_Text_HmmIsThatRight":"Hmm…\\nIs that right…$","Text_Blueprints":"It's a blueprint of some sort.\\nIt's filled with diagrams and text.$","PalletTown_Text_OakGrassUnsafeNeedMon":"OAK: It's unsafe!\\nWild POKéMON live in tall grass!\\pYou need your own POKéMON for\\nyour protection.\\pI know!\\nHere, come with me!$","Text_PlayerBootedUpPC":"{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$","CableClub_Text_HopeYouEnjoyWirelessSystem":"I hope you enjoy the Wireless\\nCommunication System.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiPostBattle":"The POKéMON LEAGUE?\\nYou? Don't get cocky!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BeautifulPieceOfAmber":"There is a beautiful piece of\\nAMBER in a clear gold color.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingCharmander":"Ah! CHARMANDER is your choice.\\nYou should raise it patiently.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you're claiming the\\nFIRE POKéMON CHARMANDER?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_BlankEncyclopedia":"It's like an encyclopedia, but the\\npages are blank.$","Route21_North_Text_IanPostBattle":"IAN: Come on, Sis!\\pYou're not going to lose weight\\nlike this!$","Route3_Text_ColtonRematchIntro":"Hey!\\nI saw you in VIRIDIAN FOREST!$","Text_FoundTMHMContainsMove":"{PLAYER} found a {STR_VAR_2}!\\nIt contains {STR_VAR_1}.$","Text_DreamEaterTaught":"…ZZZ…\\nI…can't eat…anymore…$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetMeTakeYouToTheTop":"Hiya!\\nDo you want to dream big?\\pDo you dare to dream of becoming\\nthe POKéMON champ?\\pI'm no TRAINER, but I can advise\\nyou on how to win.\\pLet me take you to the top!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoIntro":"Karate is the ultimate form of\\nmartial arts!$","Text_AccessedBillsPC":"Accessed BILL's PC.$","PokedexRating_Text_SeenXOwnedY":"The amount of progress you've made\\non your POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.\\p{FONT_NORMAL}PROF. OAK's rating:$","PokedexRating_Text_HowIsPokedexComingAlong":"OAK: Good to see you!\\nHow is your POKéDEX coming along?\\pHere, let me take a look.$","PalletTown_Text_OakLetMeSeePokedex":"OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nYou're back, are you?\\pHow much have you filled in your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pMay I see it?\\pLet's see…$","ViridianForest_Text_RickDefeat":"No!\\nCATERPIE can't hack it!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTakeTheseWithYou":"OAK: {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}.\\nTake these with you.$","Route3_Text_CalvinDefeat":"Lost!\\nLost! Lost!$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_ReceivedOaksParcelFromClerk":"{PLAYER} received OAK'S PARCEL\\nfrom the POKéMON MART clerk.$","PewterCity_Text_GymSign":"PEWTER CITY POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\lThe Rock-Solid POKéMON TRAINER!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Its50YForChildsTicket":"Yes, yes.\\nIt's ¥50 for a child's ticket.\\pWould you like to come in?$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_YouCameFromPallet":"Hey!\\nYou came from PALLET TOWN?$","Text_ExplainProfile":"A profile is written using four\\nwords or phrases.\\pThere're plenty of words to choose\\nfrom for your profile.\\pThe words and phrases are placed\\nin several convenient groups.\\pFirst, choose a group, then choose\\na word or phrase.\\p…It's easier than it sounds.\\nWhy don't you try it?$","Text_AdvertisingPoster":"It's an advertising poster about\\nall kinds of products.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNeedYourHelpTooNeedToSeePokedexes":"OAK: I know, I know.\\nOf course I need your help, too.\\pNow, I need to see both your\\nPOKéDEXES.$","PokedexRating_Text_Wroooaaarrr":"Wroooooooaaaaaarrrr!$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradingPikachuWithKid":"I'm trading POKéMON with that kid\\nthere.\\pI had two PIKACHU, so I figured\\nI might as well trade one.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeIntro":"Your POKéMON will cower at the\\ncrack of my whip!$","Route3_Text_JanicePostBattle":"You shouldn't be staring if you\\ndon't want to battle!$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ExplainHM05":"HM05 contains the hidden move\\nFLASH.\\pFLASH lights up even the darkest\\nof caves and dungeons.$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCentersHealMons":"POKéMON CENTERS heal your tired,\\nhurt, or fainted POKéMON.\\pThey make all POKéMON completely\\nhealthy.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_EmailMessage":"There's an e-mail message here.\\p…\\pFinally!\\nThe ultimate TRAINERS of the\\lPOKéMON LEAGUE are ready to\\ltake on all comers!\\pBring your best POKéMON and see\\nhow you rate as a TRAINER!\\pPOKéMON LEAGUE HQ\\nINDIGO PLATEAU\\pPROF. OAK, please visit us!\\n…$","Text_GiveNicknameToThisMon":"Do you want to give a nickname to\\nthis {STR_VAR_1}?$","Trade_Text_WhatThatsNoMon":"What?\\nThat's no {STR_VAR_1}!$","Route3_Text_JamesRematchIntro":"I'll battle you with the POKéMON\\nI started raising.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WhatsSpecialAboutMoonStone":"MOON STONE, huh?\\pWhat's so special about it?\\nLooks like an ordinary rock to me.$","ViridianForest_Text_AvoidGrassyAreasWhenWeak":"TRAINER TIPS\\pIf your POKéMON are weak and you\\nwant to avoid battles, stay away\\lfrom grassy areas!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ReceivedOldAmberFromMan":"{PLAYER} received the OLD AMBER\\nfrom the man.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_OopsWrongSide":"Oops, wrong side…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNowTheseUnitsCanRecordMoreData":"… … …  … … …\\p… … …  … … …\\p…And that's done!\\pNow these units can record data on\\na lot more POKéMON.$","Aide_Text_HaventCaughtEnoughMonsForItem":"Let's see…\\nUh-oh! You have caught only\\l{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\\pYou need {STR_VAR_1} kinds\\nif you want the {STR_VAR_2}.$","ViridianForest_Text_FriendsItchingToBattle":"I came here with some friends to\\ncatch us some BUG POKéMON!\\pThey're all itching to get into\\nsome POKéMON battles!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LookingNiceInNoTime":"DAISY: Okay, I'll get it looking\\nnice in no time.$","Text_RivalVictory":"{RIVAL}: Yeah!\\nAm I great or what?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainSleep":"A POKéMON can't attack if it's\\nasleep.\\pPOKéMON will stay asleep even\\nafter battles.\\pUse AWAKENING to awaken one\\nfrom sleep.$","Text_TakeYourPkmnForFewSeconds":"Okay, I'll take your POKéMON for a\\nfew seconds.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OaksLastMon":"That's PROF. OAK's last POKéMON.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingBulbasaur":"I see! BULBASAUR is your choice.\\nIt's very easy to raise.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you want to go with\\nthe GRASS POKéMON BULBASAUR?$","PalletTown_Text_PressStartToOpenMenuCopy":"TRAINER TIPS!\\pPress START to open the MENU!$","Text_Telephone":"It's a telephone.\\nBetter not use it.$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerRematchIntro":"The sea cleanses my body and soul!$","CableClub_Text_PleaseVisitAgain":"Please do visit again.$","Route21_North_Text_LilRematchIntro":"LIL: Huh? A battle again?\\nIAN, can't you do it alone?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakSightingsOfRareMons":"Recently, there have been sightings\\nof many rare POKéMON species.\\pI'm talking about POKéMON that\\nhave never been seen in KANTO.\\pI would love to go see things for\\nmyself, but I'm much too old.\\pSince I can't do it, {PLAYER}, I'd\\nlike you to go in my place.$","Text_BlinkingLights":"Lights in different colors are\\nflashing on and off.$","Text_Cup":"It's a cup with a POKéMON mark\\non it.$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerPostBattle":"The sea is great and all, but I\\nlike the mountains, too.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedPokedexFromOak":"{PLAYER} received the POKéDEX\\nfrom PROF. OAK.$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyIntro":"Hey, wait up!\\nWhat's the hurry? Why the rush?$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: Hey! {PLAYER}!\\pYou're off to the POKéMON LEAGUE?\\nForget about it!\\pYou probably don't have any\\nBADGES, do you?\\pThe guard won't let you through\\nwithout them.\\pBy the way, did your POKéMON get\\nany stronger?$","PewterCity_Text_ClefairyCameFromMoon":"CLEFAIRY came from the moon.\\nThat's what the rumor is.\\pThey appeared after MOON STONES\\nfell on MT. MOON.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: ?\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFirstPage":"Let's check out the notebook.\\pFirst page…\\pPOKé BALLS are used to catch\\nPOKéMON.\\pUp to six POKéMON can be carried\\nin your party.\\pPeople who raise and battle\\nwith POKéMON are called TRAINERS.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_PleaseGiveMonsRest":"DAISY: Just like people, POKéMON\\nare living things.\\pWhen they get tired, please give\\nthem a rest.$","Text_AccessedPlayersPC":"Accessed {PLAYER}'s PC.$","Route3_Text_GregIntro":"Are you a TRAINER?\\nLet's get with it right away!$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerIntro":"The sea cleanses my body and soul!$","ViridianCity_Text_GymSign":"VIRIDIAN CITY POKéMON GYM$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoChoosePlayer":"{RIVAL}: Heh, I don't need to be\\ngreedy like you. I'm mature!\\pGo ahead and choose, {PLAYER}!$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldRematchIntro":"You want to know if the fish are\\nbiting?$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_AllGirlsLeaveOakLookingForYou":"MOM: …Right.\\nAll girls dream of traveling.\\lIt said so on TV.\\pOh, yes. PROF. OAK, next door, was\\nlooking for you.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalNoFairWhatAboutMe":"{RIVAL}: Hey! Gramps! No fair!\\nWhat about me?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakWhichOneWillYouChoose":"OAK: Now, {PLAYER}.\\pInside those three POKé BALLS are\\nPOKéMON.\\pWhich one will you choose for\\nyourself?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainPoison":"When poisoned, a POKéMON's health\\nsteadily drops.\\pPoison lingers after battles.\\nUse an ANTIDOTE to cure poison!$","ViridianForest_Text_ContactOakViaPCToRatePokedex":"TRAINER TIPS\\pContact PROF. OAK via a PC to\\nget your POKéDEX evaluated!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveRequestForYouTwo":"OAK: Oh, right!\\nI have a request for you two.$","Text_PokemartSign":"All your item needs fulfilled!\\nPOKéMON MART$","Text_TellMoreNextTime":"Please tell me more about\\nyourself next time!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoPostBattle":"If my POKéMON were as good at\\nkarate as I…$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AskedDaddyToCatchPikachu":"I want a PIKACHU!\\nIt's so cute!\\pI asked my daddy to catch me one!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalWhatDidYouCallMeFor":"{RIVAL}: I almost forgot!\\nWhat did you call me for?$","PewterCity_Text_ReceivedRunningShoesFromAide":"{PLAYER} received the\\nRUNNING SHOES from the AIDE.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFourthPage":"Fourth page…\\pThe ultimate goal for all POKéMON\\nTRAINERS is simple.\\pIt is to defeat the top eight\\nPOKéMON GYM LEADERS.\\pDo so to earn the right to face…\\pThe ELITE FOUR of the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE!$","ViridianCity_House_Text_NicknamingIsFun":"Coming up with nicknames is fun,\\nbut it's not so easy to do.\\pClever names are nice, but simple\\nnames are easier to remember.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontLikeWayItGlaresAtYou":"{PLAYER}, I don't like the way it\\nglares at you.\\pCould you try being a little nicer\\nto it?$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradingMyClefairyForPikachu":"I really want a PIKACHU, so I'm\\ntrading my CLEFAIRY for one.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetsGetHappening":"All right!\\nLet's get happening!$","CableClub_Text_PleaseWaitBCancel":"Please wait.\\n… … B Button: Cancel$","Route1_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 1\\nPALLET TOWN - VIRIDIAN CITY$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCompleteMonGuideWasMyDream":"To make a complete guide on all\\nthe POKéMON in the world…\\pThat was my dream!\\pBut, I'm too old.\\nI can't get the job done.\\pSo, I want you two to fulfill my\\ndream for me.\\pGet moving, you two.\\pThis is a great undertaking in\\nPOKéMON history!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_RunningSpaceExhibitThisMonth":"This month, we're running a space\\nexhibit.$","Route2_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 2\\nVIRIDIAN CITY - PEWTER CITY$","ViridianForest_Text_UseAntidoteForPoison":"For poison, use ANTIDOTE!\\nGet it at POKéMON MARTS!$","Aide_Text_GetEnoughMonsComeBackForItem":"…Oh. I see.\\pWhen you get {STR_VAR_1} kinds of POKéMON,\\ncome back for the {STR_VAR_2}.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_HiBrothersAtLab":"DAISY: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\pMy brother, {RIVAL}, is out at\\nGrandpa's LAB.$","PalletTown_Text_CaughtXPuttingInHonestEffort":"You've caught {STR_VAR_2}…\\pHm, it looks as if you're putting\\nin an honest effort.\\pWhen you manage to fill it some\\nmore, come show me, please.$","CableClub_Text_PlayWhichBattleMode":"Which Battle Mode would you like\\nto play?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiIntro":"Heh!\\nYou must be running out of steam\\lby now!$"};
